Recommends: cron | cron-daemon
Description: Tool for updating MaxMind GeoIP and GeoLite databases
 The GeoIP Update program performs automatic updates of MaxMind's GeoIP and
 GeoLite binary databases.
 .
 A MaxMind account is required. Put your account ID and license key in
 /etc/GeoIP.conf; until you do, the scheduled runs shipped with this package
 skip themselves rather than contacting MaxMind with the placeholder
 credentials.
